id: enhanced-organism
name: Enhanced Organism
order: 1
optionOf: technological-being
optionEffect: 2
# A Saving Throw chosen as it is gained - its Racial Saving Throw Bonus.
choose: savingThrow
description: >
  Gain the Alternate Upbringing Factor, ignoring its Racial Requirements. You must exchange the Functional Purpose Racial Trait for the Factor Trait. Additionally, increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2 and select an additional Saving Throw to apply your Racial Saving Throw Bonus to.
text: >
  Enhanced Organism [Passive]: Gain the Alternate Upbringing Factor, ignoring its Racial Requirements. You must exchange the Functional Purpose Racial Trait for the Factor Trait. Additionally, increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2 and select an additional Saving Throw to apply your Racial Saving Throw Bonus to.

---

# The Factor Trait taken by hand, Functional Purpose with it - the table's; Alternate Upbringing's Factor Traits listed among
# those this character fits (racial.mjs factorTraitFits). The Saving Throw, chosen when it is gained.
[passive]
racialLifeModifier += 2;
allow save.racial.$choice;
allow factor.ignoreRequirement.alternate-upbringing;
